      "help": "Classic plates come from a reviewed pack of public-domain illustrations; birds without one get a photo toned to match. The AI options need a fal.ai key in the widget settings. In the cluster layout the AI options paint each bird and blend them into one picture; otherwise it shows their own pictures side by side.",
      "choices": [
