      "default": "",
      "placeholder": "an Art Nouveau illustration with sinuous flowing lines, a muted palette of sage, ochre and dusty rose, and a border of curling leaves and lilies, on plain cream paper",
      "help": "Describe the medium and the look, as the example does; the widget adds the bird, its reference photo and the plain background. Each wording keeps its own paintings, so a changed prompt paints afresh and the old ones wait on the paintings page. Blank uses the example.",
